{
  "id": "fab",
  "name": "Floating Action Button",
  "category": "Buttons & Actions",
  "description": "Floating action button in three sizes plus an extended pill shape, with a speed dial, a positions helper, hide-on-scroll and a tooltip.",
  "tier": "component",
  "install": "dashcn add fab",
  "import": "import 'package:<your_app>/ui/dashcn/components/fab/fab.dart';",
  "tags": [
    "control",
    "button",
    "floating",
    "action",
    "speed-dial",
    "scroll"
  ],
  "deps": {
    "foundation": [],
    "theme": [
      "color_tokens",
      "density",
      "theme",
      "tokens"
    ],
    "primitives": [
      "animated_value_builder",
      "clickable",
      "hidden",
      "motion",
      "surface",
      "touch_hit_area"
    ],
    "components": [
      "tooltip"
    ]
  },
  "files": [
    "fab.dart",
    "fab_content.dart",
    "fab_defaults.dart",
    "fab_hide_on_scroll.dart",
    "fab_positioner.dart",
    "fab_speed_dial.dart",
    "fab_speed_dial_action.dart",
    "fab_style.dart",
    "fab_theme.dart",
    "preview.dart"
  ],
  "api": {
    "classes": [
      "Fab",
      "FabSpeedDial",
      "FabSpeedDialAction",
      "FabPositioner",
      "FabHideOnScroll",
      "FabStyle",
      "FabTheme"
    ],
    "enums": [
      "FabSize",
      "FabShape",
      "FabPosition",
      "FabSpeedDialDirection",
      "FabHideOnScrollDirection"
    ],
    "typedefs": [
      "FabSpeedDialActionBuilder"
    ],
    "functions": [
      "buildFabContent",
      "fabAlignmentFor",
      "fabBoxFor",
      "fabIconFor"
    ],
    "constants": [
      "fabDefaults",
      "fabThemeOverrides",
      "fabDefaultGap",
      "fabDefaultTextStyle",
      "fabPositionerDefaultPadding"
    ]
  },
  "theme": {
    "class": "FabTheme",
    "userFile": "fab_theme.dart",
    "defaults": "fabDefaults",
    "fields": {
      "standard": "FabStyle? - the round (icon only) button",
      "extended": "FabStyle? - the pill (icon plus label) button",
      "mini": "FabStyle? - a speed-dial mini action",
      "background": "StateValue<ThemedColor>? - per-state fill",
      "foreground": "StateValue<ThemedColor>? - per-state icon/label colour",
      "borderColor": "StateValue<ThemedColor>? - null draws no border",
      "borderWidth": "double? - used when borderColor resolves",
      "shadowColor": "ThemedColor? - shadow colour, foreground at 25%",
      "elevation": "double? - shadow strength, 3 (2 for a mini action)",
      "padding": "EdgeInsetsGeometry? - inner padding of the button box",
      "labelPadding": "EdgeInsetsGeometry? - gap between icon and label",
      "gap": "double? - gap between icon and label, 8",
      "textStyle": "TextStyle? - label style, 14 w600",
      "iconSize": "double? - icon size, from the size table",
      "borderRadius": "BorderRadiusGeometry? - null = pill/circle",
      "surfaceOpacity": "double? - floating fill opacity override",
      "surfaceBlur": "double? - floating fill blur override",
      "size": "double? - box size override"
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "The button is a floating surface: its fill goes through `primitives/surface.dart` (`surfaceColor` + `GlassSurface`), so the ambient `ThemeData.surfaceOpacity` / `surfaceBlur` apply to it.",
    "Touch platforms expand the hit-test/semantics region with invisible `TouchHitArea` (no layout change), never the painted circle.",
    "`FabSpeedDial` is controlled when `expanded` is non-null and uncontrolled otherwise.",
    "`FabHideOnScroll` reads a `ScrollController` when one is passed and the scroll notifications otherwise."
  ]
}
